\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x)\\,\\text{d}x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-973bb348-68db-5f8b-b078-a1a0c39d3c7a" :answer-field/id #uuid "973bb348-68db-5f8b-b078-a1a0c39d3c7a" :answer-field/key "field-4" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/correct "answer-282319fc-9f02-5762-9c82-02e738760f50" :answer-field/choices ["answer-6ca8a579-ff53-5300-90a1-e3d79fe3860b" "answer-282319fc-9f02-5762-9c82-02e738760f50" "answer-2efa14e1-1baa-5b6a-aca2-16ad73854b7f" "answer-a7ce2c20-81df-5f4b-bee3-3cd8d0542cee"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-6ca8a579-ff53-5300-90a1-e3d79fe3860b" :answer/id #uuid "6ca8a579-ff53-5300-90a1-e3d79fe3860b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{4\\pi }" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-282319fc-9f02-5762-9c82-02e738760f50" :answer/id #uuid "282319fc-9f02-5762-9c82-02e738760f50" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-2efa14e1-1baa-5b6a-aca2-16ad73854b7f" :answer/id #uuid "2efa14e1-1baa-5b6a-aca2-16ad73854b7f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{\\pi }" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-a7ce2c20-81df-5f4b-bee3-3cd8d0542cee" :answer/id #uuid "a7ce2c20-81df-5f4b-bee3-3cd8d0542cee" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{4}{\\pi }" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-e5dac63d-6b9e-5dfb-b42e-18dabc9a7e34" :answer-field/id #uuid "e5dac63d-6b9e-5dfb-b42e-18dabc9a7e34" :answer-field/key "field-5" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/correct "answer-477216e7-29ff-535c-919b-7c0025478625" :answer-field/choices ["answer-477216e7-29ff-535c-919b-7c0025478625" "answer-e671311a-a6c6-5590-aa9c-c58e95336c2b" "answer-e582708c-30ab-51b7-8fac-ed5cfb399655" "answer-d1a2e1c1-74f1-595f-8870-09a1c08cfd5d" "answer-ff0d9dcc-3414-5481-a1ea-2423a23ed503" "answer-9e7c78ab-810e-5194-923c-bb29e87bc1a4"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-477216e7-29ff-535c-919b-7c0025478625" :answer/id #uuid "477216e7-29ff-535c-919b-7c0025478625" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{\\int }_{-4}^{4}{cos}^{2}⁡(x)\\,\\text{d}x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-e671311a-a6c6-5590-aa9c-c58e95336c2b" :answer/id #uuid "e671311a-a6c6-5590-aa9c-c58e95336c2b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{\\int }_{-4}^{4}{cos}^{2}⁡(x)\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\pi x)\\,\\text{d}x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-e582708c-30ab-51b7-8fac-ed5cfb399655" :answer/id #uuid "e582708c-30ab-51b7-8fac-ed5cfb399655" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{\\int }_{-4}^{4}{cos}^{2}⁡(x)\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\pi x)\\,\\text{d}x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-d1a2e1c1-74f1-595f-8870-09a1c08cfd5d" :answer/id #uuid "d1a2e1c1-74f1-595f-8870-09a1c08cfd5d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{\\int }_{-\\pi }^{\\pi }\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x)\\,\\text{d}x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-ff0d9dcc-3414-5481-a1ea-2423a23ed503" :answer/id #uuid "ff0d9dcc-3414-5481-a1ea-2423a23ed503" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{\\int }_{-\\pi }^{\\pi }{cos}^{2}⁡(x)\\,\\text{d}x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-9e7c78ab-810e-5194-923c-bb29e87bc1a4" :answer/id #uuid "9e7c78ab-810e-5194-923c-bb29e87bc1a4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{\\int }_{-\\pi }^{\\pi }{cos}^{3}⁡(x)\\,\\text{d}x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-4886c497-1cb0-54c5-b33a-8a4433090897" :question/id #uuid "4886c497-1cb0-54c5-b33a-8a4433090897" :question/math-academy-id "q-341778" :question/problem "Let $f(x)$ be the $2L$-periodic extension of a function $F(x)$ from $x\\in [-L,L)$ to $x\\in R.$\nSelect the correct options in the reasoning below.\n\nThe Fourier series of $f$ is given by\n\n$$\nf(x)∼\\frac{{a}_{0}}{2}+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }{a}_{n}\\operatorname{cos}⁡({{field-1}})+{b}_{n}\\operatorname{sin}⁡({{field-2}}).\n$$\n\nThe $6$th sine coefficient of the series is\n\n$$\n{b}_{6}={{field-3}}.\n$$\n\nGiven that $F(x)={x}^{3}$ and $L=3,$ the $6$th sine coefficient becomes\n\n$$\n{b}_{6}={{field-4}}\\,\\cdot \\,{{field-5}}.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Recall that multiplying the argument of a function by $k\\ne 0$ represents the horizontal stretching of the corresponding graph by a factor of $\\frac{1}{k}.$\n\nNow, let $s=\\frac{\\pi }{L}x.$ Then, since $f(x)$ has a period of $2L,$ the function\n\n$$\ng(s)=f(\\frac{L}{\\pi }s)\n$$\n\nmust have a period of $2L\\cdot \\frac{\\pi }{L}=2\\pi .$ \n\nThe Fourier series of $g(s)$ is\n\n$$\ng(s)∼\\frac{{a}_{0}}{2}+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }{a}_{n}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(ns)+{b}_{n}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(ns),\n$$\n\nwhere:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{a}_{0} & =\\frac{1}{\\pi }{\\int }_{-\\pi }^{\\pi }g(s)\\,\\text{d}s \\\\ {a}_{n} & =\\frac{1}{\\pi }{\\int }_{-\\pi }^{\\pi }g(s)\\operatorname{cos}⁡(ns)\\,\\text{d}s,\\,n\\ge 1 \\\\ {b}_{n} & =\\frac{1}{\\pi }{\\int }_{-\\pi }^{\\pi }g(s)\\operatorname{sin}⁡(ns)\\,\\text{d}s,\\,n\\ge 1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting $s=\\frac{\\pi }{L}x$ and using the fact that $g(s)=f(\\frac{L}{\\pi }s),$ we get the Fourier series of $f(x):$\n\n$$\nf(x)∼\\frac{{a}_{0}}{2}+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }{a}_{n}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi }{L}x)+{b}_{n}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi }{L}x)\n$$\n\nTherefore, $6$th sine coefficient of $f(x)$ is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{b}_{6} & =\\frac{1}{\\pi }{\\int }_{-\\pi }^{\\pi }g(s)\\operatorname{sin}⁡(6s)\\,\\text{d}s \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\pi }{\\int }_{-\\pi }^{\\pi }f(\\frac{L}{\\pi }s)\\operatorname{sin}⁡(6s)\\,\\text{d}s \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\pi }{\\int }_{-L}^{L}f(\\frac{L}{\\pi }\\cdot \\frac{\\pi }{L}x)\\operatorname{sin}⁡(6\\cdot \\frac{\\pi }{L}x)\\,\\text{d}(\\frac{\\pi }{L}x) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\pi }\\cdot \\frac{\\pi }{L}{\\int }_{-L}^{L}f(x)\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{6\\pi }{L}x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{L}{\\int }_{-L}^{L}f(x)\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{6\\pi }{L}x)\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, substituting $L=3$ and $f(x)={x}^{3},$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{b}_{6} & =\\frac{1}{3}{\\int }_{-3}^{3}{x}^{3}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{6\\pi }{3}x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}\\cdot {\\int }_{-3}^{3}{x}^{3}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2\\pi x)\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-a9d7c2b1-ebdc-5647-8fd1-cdc837ba2e78" "answer-field-0a7def3a-9fa5-59bc-9703-0d0ced74cc15" "answer-field-d24575e5-699f-5456-96dd-cc5375bcde7a" "answer-field-0bf764ef-1beb-5feb-a5d4-29b3185e36ab" "answer-field-c2939d33-2683-5e5e-b87f-2f0d344063b9"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-a9d7c2b1-ebdc-5647-8fd1-cdc837ba2e78" :answer-field/id #uuid "a9d7c2b1-ebdc-5647-8fd1-cdc837ba2e78" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/correct "answer-5ddc8995-f47b-5b1d-ab95-02eb09995ed1" :answer-field/choices ["answer-6d595da7-7f84-516d-b628-aa452ca2b722" "answer-6eff947c-8bb4-5509-893e-1e1e8987a8c6" "answer-5ddc8995-f47b-5b1d-ab95-02eb09995ed1" "answer-80e6e5a7-fe8b-50b6-aad5-976b789e96de"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-6d595da7-7f84-516d-b628-aa452ca2b722" :answer/id #uuid "6d595da7-7f84-516d-b628-aa452ca2b722" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{L}{n\\pi }x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-6eff947c-8bb4-5509-893e-1e1e8987a8c6" :answer/id #uuid "6eff947c-8bb4-5509-893e-1e1e8987a8c6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{nL}{\\pi }x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-5ddc8995-f47b-5b1d-ab95-02eb09995ed1" :answer/id #uuid "5ddc8995-f47b-5b1d-ab95-02eb09995ed1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{n\\pi }{L}x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-80e6e5a7-fe8b-50b6-aad5-976b789e96de" :answer/id #uuid "80e6e5a7-fe8b-50b6-aad5-976b789e96de" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{n}{L\\pi }x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-0a7def3a-9fa5-59bc-9703-0d0ced74cc15" :answer-field/id #uuid "0a7def3a-9fa5-59bc-9703-0d0ced74cc15" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/correct "answer-d044acb7-a030-5dd1-8853-cf890eed2981" :answer-field/choices ["answer-3c31f1c7-dc62-5f6e-ae3f-6593541f6c1e" "answer-8910bd6b-8a7e-5e71-93b6-16610a05afa0" "answer-d044acb7-a030-5dd1-8853-cf890eed2981" "answer-45dd921e-846a-5eef-bdba-5c2ce78f3846"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-3c31f1c7-dc62-5f6e-ae3f-6593541f6c1e" :answer/id #uuid "3c31f1c7-dc62-5f6e-ae3f-6593541f6c1e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{L}{n\\pi }x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-8910bd6b-8a7e-5e71-93b6-16610a05afa0" :answer/id #uuid "8910bd6b-8a7e-5e71-93b6-16610a05afa0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{nL}{\\pi }x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-d044acb7-a030-5dd1-8853-cf890eed2981" :answer/id #uuid "d044acb7-a030-5dd1-8853-cf890eed2981" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{n\\pi }{L}x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-45dd921e-846a-5eef-bdba-5c2ce78f3846" :answer/id #uuid "45dd921e-846a-5eef-bdba-5c2ce78f3846" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{n}{L\\pi }x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-d24575e5-699f-5456-96dd-cc5375bcde7a" :answer-field/id #uuid "d24575e5-699f-5456-96dd-cc5375bcde7a" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/correct "answer-6b54c63d-6367-5121-8b46-fa32b2d6365f" :answer-field/choices ["answer-2e50c090-e2ce-5c63-a2c9-146ede30820c" "answer-541c2cbf-9b2c-5091-88fa-4b3a5ac3c8c0" "answer-6b54c63d-6367-5121-8b46-fa32b2d6365f" "answer-e2f12b06-46ca-594c-ba89-e1d7d2ac11d1" "answer-00561c08-ad3b-5d9b-ac8d-d1c849b75bfa" "answer-73ee4e81-95a1-562c-b139-d8c63a070d9c"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-2e50c090-e2ce-5c63-a2c